Exile Store
===========

Attribution
-----------
This source tree was written from scratch for the Exile project. No code from
SerenityOS or any other upstream project was copied into it, because no Exile OS /
Serenity-derived repository was available when it was created (see docs/AUDIT.md).
If it is merged into a Serenity-derived tree, that tree's own LICENSE and
third-party notices continue to apply to the combined work and must be preserved.

License
-------
The Exile Store source files carry "SPDX-License-Identifier: BSD-2-Clause" headers, the same license as the
repository root (see ../../../LICENSE). The copyright line reads "the Exile OS developers", which is a
placeholder collective name modelled on the repository's existing "the SerenityOS developers" notices: the
project owner must confirm the correct copyright holder and license before this code is distributed, and
qualified legal review is recommended. Earlier revisions of this file said no license had been chosen; that
was resolved by adopting the repository's required header format, not by a recorded licensing decision.

Third-party dependencies
------------------------
- OpenSSL (libcrypto): Ed25519 signature verification and key generation in the
  developer tool. Not bundled. Linked from the system. See https://www.openssl.org/
  for its license terms.

No other third-party code is included. The JSON parser, SHA-256, semantic version
comparison and package container are original implementations in src/core/.
